  "body_human_readable": "## Weather in Kyiv: Sunny Skies and Pleasant Temperatures\n\nAs of Friday in Kyiv, the weather is sunny with a current temperature of 24\u00b0C (76\u00b0F). It feels like 25\u00b0C (77\u00b0F) with a low chance of rain at 0%.\n\nThe humidity is currently around 42% to 60%. A north wind is blowing at a speed of 9 km/h.\n\nThe forecast for the rest of the day indicates that it will remain sunny, becoming clear overnight. The high for today is expected to be between 26\u00b0C (79\u00b0F) and 29\u00b0C (84\u00b0F), with the overnight low around 12\u00b0C (54\u00b0F). There are currently no active weather alerts for the city.",
